 ___[ Navigating Directories ]_______________________________________________
|
|  pwd
|      --- Shows current working directory
|  cd <folder>
|      --- Changes to specified folder
|  cd ..
|      --- Moves up to parent folder
|  cd /
|      --- Moves to root directory
|  (no equivalent)
|      --- Switches active drive and enters folder [no equivalent on Linux]
|  ls -la
|      --- Lists files and details in directory
|  tree
|      --- Displays graphical directory tree structure
|  clear
|      --- Clears the terminal screen
|____________________________________________________________________________
